    "proof_sketch": "Paley/conference C satisfies C1=0. V\u208a = +p eigenspace is orthogonal to 1, so P\u208a1=0. B=P\u208aBP\u208a \u21d2 B1=0. Zero diagonal \u21d2 1\u1d40B1 = 2\u2211_{i<j} B_ij = S1 (with Be=2B_ij). Hence S1=0."
  },
